// main.kn
// ============================================================================
// ============================================================================
//  GPU TOOLS — Entry Point
// ============================================================================
//  PHASES:
//    1. Metal Probe      - rdtsc, CPUID, VM page size
//    2. Package Probe    - all 21 packages imported and verified
//    3. Pre-Simulation   - exercise semantic stack without pygame
//    4. Bridge           - register python_actor_callback, bind to __main__
//    5. Launch           - python_exec the GPU compute bootstrap (BLOCKS)
//    6. Validate         - check world state, mirror propagation, telemetry
//
//  NO components. NO surface native_ui. Pygame + moderngl is the window.
// ============================================================================

